  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) Wang Lung speaks to his sons, asking about their duties.",
  "[action] The eldest son and the second son bow in reply to their father.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Well, and what is it you are about, then?\"",
  "[silence] Wang Lung says nothing.",
  "the eldest son: \"The eldest son speaks to his father about his duties.\"",
  "[action] The eldest son moves to the gate.",
  "[action] The second son leaves to do business.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Well, and you will have to come to me when you are done with your affairs,\"",
  "[action] Wang Lung returns to his room.",
  "the eldest son (to the eldest son): \"Your eldest son says he will do as his father says.\"",
  "Wang Lung: \"Well, and I suppose that is so,\"",
